      en: ["Total area: 120 km²", "Land area: 9 km²", "Lagoon area: 111 km²", "Population: approx. 200", "Main village: Omoka", "Discovery: 1788 by William Sever"],
      es: ["Superficie total: 120 km²", "Superficie terrestre: 9 km²", "Superficie de la laguna: 111 km²", "Población: aprox. 200", "Lugar principal: Omoka", "Descubrimiento: 1788 por William Sever"],
